OL,3,AMan dies after being hit by ambulance
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,6,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,7,FSunderland, Northumbria Police said.
OL,9,FThe force said it happened on the A19,
OL,10,Fbetween the junctions for the A1018 and
OL,11,FA690, shortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,13,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,14,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,15,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,16,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
