OL,3,AMan dies after being hit by ambulance
OL,4,
OL,5,FNeither the patient nor their partner
OL,6,Fwho were travelling in the ambulance
OL,7,Fwere injured in the collision, while
OL,8,Fthe vehicle's driver - a man in his 40s
OL,9,F- was also not hurt and remained at the
OL,10,Fscene to assist police with their
OL,11,Finquiries.
